  "description": "Add nostalgic holiday charm to your projects with six pastel Christmas seamless patterns featuring watercolor Santas, festive bells, village houses, reindeer, decorated trees, bows and coordinating stripes. Soft pink, mint, pale blue and buttery yellow pair with cheerful red accents throughout this Christmas digital paper collection. Includes single tiles and seamlessly repeated versions for fabric printing, gift wrap, stationery, scrapbooking and festive crafts. A whimsical Christmas pattern bundle for colorful seasonal creations.\n♡What is included:\n• 6 digital papers ( seamless patterns )\nYou will receive 2 versions of each pattern:\none single tile and one seamlessly repeated version (4 tiles combined)\nboth sized 12” x 12” | 3600×3600 at 300 dpi | .jpeg",
